B.ajj=new A.cB("source_companion","Companion","Your Companion is another character who takes their turn at the same time as you. When you trigger abilities of this source, your companion performs the ability using their stats with a source value of {Half Level}. If you do not trigger an ability of this source using your [Action] on your turn, your companion may trigger their [Minion] ability. You may have multiple companions with dm approval, treating each as a separate source.\nWhen you gain a companion, build a chump of your level but without a chump action, or combat features. Your companion has a Body Composition and Body Size but doesn't gain any bonuses related to the Body Composition or Body Size. Pick one of the below companion options, which changes the companion's Max HP.\nCompanions do not have turns but act during your turn. Companions are characters for the purposes of effects. Companions have reactions, and can concentrate. They may move up to their speed on each of your turns. If you perform a [Run] or [Retreat] your companions also take the action.","When you fail a skill or defense check, you may have your companion make the check instead. You may do this {points} times per Story.","Your companion starts next situation with {Level * Their Vitality} Shield.","Your companion has a -1 to check results.","{Half Level}",B.Fs,!1,null,null,B.a6q,B.M,"{1}")
