B.T4=new A.m("feature_acid_splash_big_spill","Big spill","You may instead target each enemy in a 1 space radius range 6 instead. On success, knock the target prone.")
B.UN=new A.m("feature_acid_splash_protection_penetrator","Protection Penetrator","The burn ignores Shields. When the target takes damage from this burn, remove shield equal to the burn.")
B.QE=new A.m("feature_acid_splash_unreasonably_concentrated","Unreasonably Concentrated","The target and their allies must succeed an Int Defense check when they use an action to remove the burn. The target and their allies have disadvantage when they spend a [Reaction] action to end this burning.")
B.a5Y=s([B.T4,B.UN,B.QE],t.U)
B.XU=new A.aj("feature_acid_splash","Acid Splash","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range 4/8. On success, the target gains {Source} d6 Burn vs Int. This burn damage ignores Resistance.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack during their turn, spend your reaction and give the targets {Half Source}d6 Burn vs Int. This burn ignores resistance.",B.F,B.a5Y,!1)
B.T1=new A.m("feature_annihilation_absorption","Absorption","On Success with the action, Before damage, Gain {Half Source d6} shield and reduce the target\u2019s shield by the same amount.")
B.Ri=new A.m("feature_annihilation_destabilize","Destabilize","On Success with the action, until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Source d6} extra damage on success with attacks against the target.")
B.US=new A.m("feature_annihilation_demoralize","Demoralize","On Success with the action, until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on attacks that target you.")
B.a7I=s([B.T1,B.Ri,B.US],t.U)
B.WY=new A.aj("feature_annihilation","Annihilation","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Int against 1 enemy range 1, on success deal {Source d10} Damage ignoring shields and resistance and until the start of your next turn, if the target dies, They respawn at Half Health. If the target has an instead of death ability, reduce their new Health total by half.\n\n[Reaction] When a creature range 1 dies, [Reaction] and The target respawns at half health. If the target has an instead of death effect, reduce their new Health total by half.",B.F,B.a7I,!1)
B.U6=new A.m("feature_attach_absorption","Absorption","When you succeed on an attach attack vs an enemy gain {Source d6} Shield. When you are attached to an ally, they may use your shield when attacked.")
B.Vb=new A.m("feature_attach_burrowing","Burrowing","When an enemy starts their turn with you attached, they gain {Half Source} d6 Bleed. When an ally starts their turn with you attached, They take {Half Source d6} damage and they gain {Half Source} d12 Regeneration.")
B.VW=new A.m("feature_attach_scuttling","Scuttling","When an enemy ends their turn with you attached, make a Status Check vs Str. On Success, force them to move {Source}. When an ally ends their turn with you attached, force them to move {Half Source}.")
B.a8v=s([B.U6,B.Vb,B.VW],t.U)
B.Ye=new A.aj("feature_attach","Attach","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy range 1, On Success deal {Source d12} and Until the start of your next turn you are attached to the target, gaining +1 to Defense results. Whenever the target changes spaces, you follow them, dashing to a free space adjacent to them. You may only be attached to 1 creature at a time. You may target an ally, On Success, give them {Source d6} Shield instead and you attach to them, regardless of success.\n\n[Reaction] During you or your allies turns, attach to that ally until the start of your next turn. When you Succeed on a Melee Attack or Fail with an Attach attack, [Reaction] to attach to one of the targets.",B.F,B.a8v,!1)
B.TW=new A.m("feature_aura_natural","Natural","You have +1 to success on your Aura Status Check and to concentrate on your aura.")
B.SX=new A.m("feature_aura_large","Large","Your Aura affects enemies within 3 spaces of you instead.")
B.VS=new A.m("feature_aura_pulse","Pulse","[Action] While you are concentrating on your aura, Make an attack as if you had just activated the aura.")
