B.Xp=new A.aj("feature_hunter","Hunter","[Action] Target an enemy you can see and begin concentrating on Hunt and make a Conceal check to hide. As long as you are concentrating, all attacks you make against the target deal an extra {Half Source d8} damage and the target cannot target you with opportunity attacks. If you start your turn and your hunt target is dead and you are concentrating on hunt, you may target another creature you can see to be the target of your hunt.\n\n[Reaction] After you or an ally succeed on an attack during their turn, choose 1 of the targets and begin concentration on Hunt and either, dash {Source}, or dash {Half Source} and make a Conceal check to hide yourself.\n\n[Reaction] When you start your turn, you may spend your reaction and target an enemy you can see that becomes the target of your hunt and either dash {Source}, or dash {Half Source} and make a Conceal check to hide yourself, if the target of your hunt has died.",B.F,B.a8g,!1)
