B.QC=new A.m("feature_eruption_mud_tunnel","Mud Tunnel","Regardless of if you Succeed on the action or reaction, you may concentrate on eruption, making each space in a line between your start and destination and each space adjacent to the destination difficult terrain for as long as you remain concentrating.")
