B.XX=new A.aj("feature_nightmare","Nightmare","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range 4. On success, the target is knocked prone and is trapped in nightmares and is stunned. While having nightmares, on the start of the target's turn, make a status check vs int, on success the target is stunned and takes {Source d8} damage. On failure the effect ends. If the target is attacked by you or your allies, the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] Start of an enemy turn who is range 4 of you and has you or one of your allies adjacent to it. Make a Ranged Attack vs Int. On success, the target is knocked prone, is stunned and has nightmares.",B.F,B.a62,!1)
B.R0=new A.m("feature_ninja_Shuriken","Shuriken","Before Disappear or Withdraw, make an Ranged Attack targeting 1 enemy range 3/6 vs dex, On Success, Deal {Source d8} Damage.")
