B.VT=new A.m("feature_ooze_Amoeba","Amoeba","While Concentrating, You cannot be flanked, and you suffer no speed penalty for squeezing. At the start of your turn, you and the targets all dash {Half Source} spaces to free spaces where you can all fit and the targets are still all range 1 of you.")
