B.Yr=new A.aj("feature_ooze","Ooze","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting enemies range 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to each target and absorb the targets as long as you remain concentrating. While absorbed you and the targets are restrained, and at the start of your turn, Deal {Half Source d6} damage to each target and heal {Half Source d6}. You have a +1 to concentration check results caused by the targets.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends range 1 or after they miss you with a melee attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting the enemy. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and absorb the target as long as you remain concentrating.",B.F,B.a6Z,!1)
