B.XP=new A.aj("feature_puppet","Puppet","[Action] Melee Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range {Source}, On Success: The target is your puppet as long as you remain concentrating. On the Start of Its Turn, Make an Status Check Vs Int, On Success: You may have the target move up to its speed and use a single Innate Action, [Chump Action], or Skill in combat action against a target of your choice. On a Miss: The target is stunned and the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally Succeeds on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int, On Success the target becomes your puppet for as long as you remain concentrating.",B.F,B.a8d,!1)
