B.Yn=new A.aj("feature_sting","Sting","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Dex Targeting an enemy range 2, On a Success, deal {Source d6} Damage and then make an Status Check vs Vit, On Success, deal {Source d8} extra Damage. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends it turn with range 2, spend your reaction and take the string action against that enemy.",B.F,B.a5B,!1)
