B.WM=new A.aj("feature_stunning_palm","Stunning Palm","[Action: 1 Unarmed]: Make an Attack Vs Vit targeting an enemy range 1. On Success, they take {Source d6} Damage and are stunned until the start of your next turn. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, Spend your reaction, and make your stunning palm action against the triggering enemy.\n",B.F,B.a5E,!1)
