B.WT=new A.aj("feature_subjugation","Subjugation","[Reaction] At the start of a consenting ally range 3\u2019s turn, Spend your reaction and deal {Half Source d6} damage to them ignoring shield and damage reduction. Until the end of their next turn, as long as they are within 3 spaces of you, they deal {Half Source d12} extra damage on attacks and gain resistance against attacks that target Int, Wis, or Cha.\n\n[Reaction] When a consenting ally range {Source} gets problems on a check, spend your reaction, and they reroll the check with a +1 to success and they take {Half Source d6} damage ignoring shield and damage reduction. Until their next turn, as long as they are within 3 spaces of you, gain damage Resistance against attacks that target Int, Wis, or Cha.",B.aq,B.a8p,!1)
B.UT=new A.m("feature_taze_Ark","Ark","After attacking, attack another creature within 2 spaces Vs Vit. On Success, They take {Source d8} Damage, and the enemy falls prone, and may not make opportunity attacks until the start of your next turn.")
