B.Un=new A.m("feature_taze_Charging Cable","Charging Cable","On the Start of your next turn, if the target of taze remained within range 3 of you since you used it, Make a Melee Attack Vs Vit. On Success, they take {Source d10} Damage, and the enemy falls prone, and may not make opportunity attacks until the start of your next turn. Note: The target of Arch is unaffected by this.")
B.a8M=s([B.UT,B.VE,B.Un],t.U)
B.Yf=new A.aj("feature_taze","Taze","[Action] Make a Melee Attack Vs Vit Targeting 1 enemy Range 3. On Success, they take {Source d10} Damage, and the enemy falls prone, and may not make opportunity attacks until the start of your next turn.\n\n[Reaction] When an enemy range 3 makes an opportunity attack, spend your reaction, the target has disadvantage on the opportunity attack. After the attack, they take {Half Source d10} damage vs Vit, and are knocked prone.",B.F,B.a8M,!1)
B.Vh=new A.m("feature_tentacle_Slamming","Slamming","When you release the target at the start of your next turn, you may spend your [Reaction] Make Melee attack vs Dex against 1 enemy range 3, on success deal {Source d12} bludgeoning damage to the target and grabbed enemy. You may target a free space instead of an enemy to deal damage to just the held enemy.")
B.W1=new A.m("feature_tentacle_Tossing","Tossing","when the target stops being grabbed by the tentacle you may knock them prone and force them to move {Source} to a free space. If you have slamming, do this after slamming.")
