B.X7=new A.aj("feature_telekinesis","Telekinesis","[Reaction] During your turn, Spend your reaction, As long as you remain concentrating, when you use your [Action] for skills, item interaction, and abilities, you may use a free space within {Source} as the origin.\n\n[Reaction] At the Start of an enemy\u2019s turn that you can see. Make a Melee Attack vs Int. On Success, deal {Source d6} and reduce the target\u2019s speed by {Half Source}.\n",B.F,B.a7Q,!1)
B.QY=new A.m("feature_tower_Escape_Pods","Escape Pods","When the Tower is Destroyed, you or allies inside may immediately dash to a free space within {Source} instead of making a Dex defense. After you succeed with your reaction status check, dash to a free space within {Source}.")
