B.X6=new A.aj("feature_tower","Tower","[Action] Create a Wall as if you had used a skill. As long as the wall remains, you and your allies may enter the wall, and gain a {half Source} bonus to range while inside. Creatures inside may not be targeted by attacks from enemies within {Half Source} of the tower, but such enemies can still attack the tower itself. When the tower is destroyed, creatures inside must make a Dex defense or fall prone.\n\n[Reaction] After you succeed on a Melee Attack, spend your reaction and Trap one of the targets in a Tower that is a wall created as if you had used a skill. The target is restrained as long as the tower remains, cannot use reactions, and cannot target anything but the tower and has disadvantage on attacks against the tower.",B.aq,B.a5z,!1)
B.St=new A.m("feature_the_end_Angelic_Rally","Angelic Rally","On Success, target {Half source} allies in the situation and heal them {Source d6}.")
