B.Yc=new A.aj("feature_throw","Throw","[Action: 1 Unarmed]: Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1, who is no more than 1 size bigger than you: On a Success, you may throw them to a free space within {2*Source} of you and deal {Source d10} Damage. When you throw an ally, they may make a Finesse to ignore the damage, otherwise they take half damage.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed a defense against a melee attack, or an ally succeeds a defense against an enemy who is range 1 of you, spend your reaction, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, dash them into a free space within {2*Source} and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Str.",B.F,B.a6w,!1)
B.Ua=new A.m("feature_tornado_debris","Debris","Each time you move the tornado using your reaction, increase the damage it does by 1d12 up to max of {Power d12}.")
