B.Xb=new A.aj("feature_tornado","Tornado","[Action] Target a 2 space radius within 6, and make a Ranged Attack vs Wis. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to enemies there and dash all characters in the tornado to a free space within {Half Source}. Create a tornado there for as long as you remain concentrating. When a character starts its turn in the tornado, or enters it for the first time during their turn, make a Status Check vs Wis, On Success Deal {Half Source d6}, knock the target prone, and dash the target to a free space with {Half Source}. When you or allies enter, On success, they take no damage and aren\u2019t knocked prone, on Problems, they are affected as if you succeed against an enemy.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn while concentrating, Spend your reaction to move your tornado {Source} spaces. For each creature that the tornado passes over, make the status check against them, targeting no creature more than once.  ",B.F,B.a5F,!1)
B.UF=new A.m("feature_tribal_elder_Sage","Sage","After using Treatment Advice or as a [Reaction] during your turn, you may begin concentrating on sage. While concentrating sage reduce your speed by {Half Source}, and allies within {Source} of you get a +1 bonus to defense results.")
B.SR=new A.m("feature_tribal_elder_Surgeon","Surgeon","When you succeed on coordinated Aid, you end any burn or bleed the target has, if they had none heal {Source d12} instead. After using Treatment Advice, if the target had burn or bleed, make a status check and on success end the burn or bleed. If both or multiple different burns you may only end 1 effect.")
B.RS=new A.m("feature_tribal_elder_Teacher","Teacher","Allies within {Half Source} of you gain +1 to Coordinated Aid Status Checks. After you use Coordinate Aid, Until the start of your next turn, allies range {Source} of you may spend their [Reaction] during their turn or any allies turn to Target 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On Success, they heal the target {Targets vitality d6} or give the target the same amount of shield. They may target themselves, but must make the check with disadvantage.")
B.a9l=s([B.UF,B.SR,B.RS],t.U)
B.Xf=new A.aj("feature_tribal_elder","Tribal Elder","Coordinated Aid [Action]: Target {Half Source} allies range 6 and each target may choose 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On success, either Heal the ally {Source d6} or grant them {Source d6} shield, healers choice. You may target yourself. A target may heal themselves but must make the status check with disadvantage.\n\nTreatment Advice: [Reaction] When an ally range {Source} fails a defense against a status check, spend your reaction, and the target rerolls the check with a +1 to results.\n",B.aq,B.a9l,!1)
B.Um=new A.m("feature_tribal_gatherer_Hold_this","Hold this","After using any [Reaction] that triggers because an ally, the ally may give you any item they are carrying.")
