B.Hy=new A.fA("Cold","Combat: Give the targets {Level /3} Cold. Adventuring: Freeze a surface or the floor of a room making it slippery.","Give the targets {Level /3} Cold.","Freeze a surface or the floor of a room making it slippery.")
