B.atE=new A.bA("weapon_melee_Umbrella","Umbrella",B.an,"Float: After succeeding on a weapon attack, until the start of your next turn, At the start of each turn, dash {Source/3} to a free space.\nOpen[Reaction] Before you or an adjacent Ally is attacked by a Ranged Attack, you may use your reaction to give Advantage on the Defense Roll to you and all allies targeted by the attack.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
